                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Difficult and unforgiving game. Very chaotic and not very balanced, but who cares. Often it's more luck than skill if you survive but that's the charming part. In the higher levels it becomes a bullet hell game but you fly a clunky WWI fighter instead of an agile space ship.\nIt somehow reminds me of \"Save New York\" back from the 80s, but it's much more brutal. Looks kinda cheap, but it's actually quite fun.",
